            <p class="text-center" style="color: #333; font-size: 16px;">
                Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, one of the most beautiful provinces in Pakistan, has many political figures competing for seats in both the provincial (MPA) and national (MNA) assemblies. Below are the key candidates representing KP.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="candidate-boxes row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-4 g-4 mb-5">
